# Project Stack
- Flutter (Dart)
- BLoC for state management
- l10n with gen-l10n (ARB files)

# Localization
- Never hardcode strings in widgets
- Always use context.l10n.keyName (via BuildContext extension)
- All new strings must be added to lib/l10n/app_en.arb first
- Key naming: {section}{Element} in camelCase (homeTitle, authLoginButton)

# Flutter L10n Rules

When generating or editing ARB files:
- All user-facing strings must be in lib/l10n/app_en.arb
- Never hardcode strings in widgets — always use AppLocalizations.of(context)
- Key naming: {section}{Element} in camelCase
- Sections: common, auth, home, profile, (etc per screen)
- Use @@section_name: {} as section separators
- Never duplicate strings — check existing keys before adding
- Always add @key metadata block after any key with placeholders